msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Hero banner"
msgstr "首頁大橫幅"

msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "Full-width banner with site title and tagline. Without an image it shows the primary colour; with an image a dark overlay keeps the text readable."
msgstr "滿版橫幅，顯示網站名稱與副標題。沒設圖片時為主色底；設了圖片會加深色遮罩，讓文字清楚可讀。"

